# The dev lock plus the TPM tier's tpm2-pytss, for the CI job that runs the
# sealed signing key against swtpm (#462). The test job installs no TPM
# library, so without this nothing in CI imports the real TPM path.
# tpm2-pytss ships an sdist only and builds against the TSS headers
# (libtss2-dev). dev.txt constrains the shared packages so the two locks
# agree. Compile with:
#   uv pip compile requirements/tpm.in --generate-hashes --universal \
#     --python-version 3.11 -c requirements/dev.txt -o requirements/tpm.txt
-r dev.in
tpm2-pytss>=3.0
